  "— ready": "",
  "• Quick play: press Find match — you join a public queue room and\n  get paired with whoever else is searching. No code needed.\n• Play with a friend: one of you presses Host and shares the\n  6-letter room code; the other enters it under Join a match.\n• Spectate: enter a room code and press Spectate — you watch\n  live without affecting the match or its netcode.\n• Ready up when you're set; the host starts the match.\n• LAN (direct IP) skips the lobby server entirely — use it on\n  the same network or over a VPN.": ""
